15. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 19 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for the Empowerment of Women Victims of Violence (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 903);
16. Regional Regulation Number 16 of 2010 concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence (Regional Gazette of South Sumatra Province of 2010 Number 3 Series E);
17. Regional .....

